For all natural numbers $x$, $s_{\text{me}}$, and $s_{\text{opp}}$, and every boolean value $\text{isFirstMove}$, the value of $\text{catch\_up\_value\_aux}(\{x\}, s_{\text{me}}, s_{\text{opp}}, \text{isFirstMove})$ is equal to:
- `CatchUpOutcome.win`, if $s_{\text{me}} + x > s_{\text{opp}}$;
- `CatchUpOutcome.loss`, if $s_{\text{me}} + x < s_{\text{opp}}$;
- `CatchUpOutcome.draw`, if $s_{\text{me}} + x = s_{\text{opp}}$ (the remaining case).

